From 3d15a79d0e0e374ba764267d729ed4b472afa4a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hhsnake <hhsnakeg@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 17:28:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] btusb: add Qualcomm WCN785x 0489:e10a

Backport of the 0489:e10a line from mainline 2dd1c1eee3e4 ("Bluetooth:
btusb: Add 13 USB device IDs for Qualcomm WCN785x"), v6.15.

BTUSB_VALID_LE_STATES is kept, as on the other WCN785x entry (0cf3:e700)
in 6.8: mainline dropped the flag only when the quirk was inverted in
6.11.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/bluetooth/btusb.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/bluetooth/btusb.c b/drivers/bluetooth/btusb.c
index d31edad..7ddf978 100644
--- a/drivers/bluetooth/btusb.c
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/btusb.c
@@ -404,6 +404,9 @@ static const struct usb_device_id quirks_table[] = {
 						     BTUSB_VALID_LE_STATES },
 
 	/* QCA WCN785x chipset */
+	{ USB_DEVICE(0x0489, 0xe10a), .driver_info = BTUSB_QCA_WCN6855 |
+						     BTUSB_WIDEBAND_SPEECH |
+						     BTUSB_VALID_LE_STATES },
 	{ USB_DEVICE(0x0cf3, 0xe700), .driver_info = BTUSB_QCA_WCN6855 |
 						     BTUSB_WIDEBAND_SPEECH |
 						     BTUSB_VALID_LE_STATES },
